Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 13:38:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add public marketing waitlist endpoint

Adds POST /mirror/api/waitlist for the landing-page email signup form at
theundergroundrailroad.world/.

- migrations/018_marketing_waitlist.sql: marketing_waitlist table with
  UNIQUE email, source tag, truncated ip, bounded UA, status ENUM,
  timestamps, JSON metadata. utf8mb4, idempotent.
- controllers/waitlistController.ts: strict email validation,
  normalisation, per-IP sliding-window rate limit (20/hour default,
  WAITLIST_RATE_LIMIT env override), IP truncated to /24 (v4) / /48
  (v6), bounded string lengths, DB-level dedup via
  INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE. Returns identical response for
  new vs duplicate to avoid membership leaks.
- routes/waitlist.ts: thin router, no auth/subscription gate.
- index.ts: import + mount alongside emailPublicRoutes.

Typecheck clean (tsc --noEmit).

